 "text": "Iron County Economic Chamber Alliance - Welcome to Iron County.\nHome\nGreat Outdoors\nGo Out and Play\nFishing\nCamping\nKayak & Canoe\nHiking & Biking Trails\nFall Colors\nWaterfalls\nSnowmobiling & ATV\nPure Michigan\nVisit\nWelcome\nEat\nShop\nStay\nAttractions\nLocal Treasures\nMarkets & Craftshows\nMust-Do Lists\nSpring\nSummer\nFall\nWinter\nLocal Events\nIron County\nLive Here\nHistory\nParks & Playgrounds\nChurches\nVolunteer\nChamber\nOverview\nStaff & Trustees\nMembership\nMembership Directory\nProf. Development\nNewsletter\nAgenda/Minutes\nContact\nJob Board\nEconomic Development\nOverview\nEntrepreneurship\nFast Track Grant\nBusiness Support\nCounty Profile\nResources\nHome\nGreat Outdoors\nGo Out and Play\nFishing\nCamping\nKayak & Canoe\nHiking & Biking Trails\nFall Colors\nWaterfalls\nSnowmobiling & ATV\nPure Michigan\nVisit\nWelcome\nEat\nShop\nStay\nAttractions\nLocal Treasures\nMarkets & Craftshows\nMust-Do Lists\nSpring\nSummer\nFall\nWinter\nLocal Events\nIron County\nLive Here\nHistory\nParks & Playgrounds\nChurches\nVolunteer\nChamber\nOverview\nStaff & Trustees\nMembership\nMembership Directory\nProf. Development\nNewsletter\nAgenda/Minutes\nContact\nJob Board\nEconomic Development\nOverview\nEntrepreneurship\nFast Track Grant\nBusiness Support\nCounty Profile\nResources\nSearch\nThe Lakes Are Calling You\nLearn about Our Rivers and Lakes\nA Foot-Stomping Good Time\nJoin In\nHelp Us Gain Valuable Input on Recycling Needs\nTake the Materials Management Survey\nGrab the 2026 Visitor’s Guide!\nCheck out the 2026 Iron County Visitor’s Guide – it’s a great tool to learn about all Iron County has to offer! From fishing tips, waterfall maps, and restaurant guides – you’re going to want to download this free guide today.\nDownload the Free 2026 Visitor's Guide!\nIron County, Michigan\nThe Heart of the Upper Peninsula\nWelcome to your new favorite Northwoods destination! Let us treat you to the best of Yooper hospitality with wildlife & waterfalls, award-winning pizza & pasties, and unforgettable experiences to last a lifetime.\nVisit Iron County\nAttractions\nUpcoming Events\nUpcoming Events\nView all events\nOct 18, 2026\nScratch and Win Sundays\nNorthern Waters Casino Resort\nN5384 US-45, Watersmeet, MI 49969\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 18, 2026\nNordic Brass\nSt. Mark's Episcopal Church\n809 Crystal Ave, Crystal Falls, MI 49920\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 22, 2026\nOctober 22 Bingo Night\nCrystal Falls/Iron River Masonic Lodge\n815 Crystal Ave, Crystal Falls, MI 49920\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 24, 2026\nCandy Bash\nDowntown Iron River\nIron River, MI\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 24, 2026\nCandy Bash\nCrystal Falls Downtown\nCrystal Falls, MI\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 24, 2026\nCoffee & Donuts for Vets\nTufts Rondon VFW Post #289\n108 Superior Ave, Crystal Falls, MI\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 24, 2026\nHalloween Party\nYoung's\n159 Youngs Lane Crystal Falls, MI 49920\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 24, 2026\nhalloween Party at ICMCF\nIron County Medical Care Facility\n1523 U.S. Rte 2, Crystal Falls, MI 49920\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 24, 2026\nHalloween Candy Bash\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 25, 2026\nScratch and Win Sundays\nNorthern Waters Casino Resort\nN5384 US-45, Watersmeet, MI 49969\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 25, 2026\nTrunk or Treat\nAlpha MI Brewery\nAlpha, MI\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nOct 31, 2026\nHalloween Party\nBeechwood Hall\n178 Beechwood Store Iron River, MI 49935\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nA Place to Call Home\nAnswer the Call of the Northwoods\nSet up camp and kindle the fire in your chest in a community rich in history, natural beauty, and friendly folk who’d be happy to call you “neighbor.”\nLive Here\nGrow Your Business Here\nReserve your camping space online!\nThe Klint Safford Memorial RV Park is nestled on the Iron River and alongside the Apple Blossom Trail. Reserve your campsite today!\nReserve a campsite\nA Place to Explore\n250 Lakes, 200 Miles of Rivers & No Traffic\nWhether you’re an outdoor enthusiast, “indoorsy,” or a little of both, Iron County will capture your interest and keep you entertained with endless outdoor recreation opportunities, and a multitude of cultural treasures to satisfy your appetite for art, music and history.\nThe Great Outdoors\nLocal Treasures\nIron County Michigan. Been there, going back!\nWelcome to the ICECA!\nAddress:\n50 East Genesee Street\nIron River, MI 49935\n(906) 265-3822\nVisitor Center Hours\nMonday-Friday\n10AM – 3PM\nAbout this Site\nThe Iron County Economic Chamber Alliance (The Alliance) serves the communities of Iron County with professional Chamber of Commerce and Economic Development Services.\nCopyright 2004-2023\nFacebook\nChange Location\nFind awesome listings near you!\nChange Location",
